{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765119,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Shark Tank | Unnati x Prarambh ","festival_id":null,"organization_id":784876,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-04T08:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-15T15:30:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/shark-tank-unnati-x-prarambh-jesus-mary-collegejmc-new-delhi-1765119","region":"hybrid","details":"<p>A market waiting to be disrupted. An opportunity waiting to be explored. An idea waiting to become a business.<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to SHARK TANK, where ambition meets business acumen and every idea has the potential to become the next big thing.<\/p>\n<p>Think you can spot an opportunity, create a product around it, and convince others that your idea is worth backing?<\/p>\n<p>Here&rsquo;s your chance to find out.<\/p>\n<p>From identifying a problem to creating a product and pitching it to a panel of judges, this competition is a test of your creativity, entrepreneurial thinking, business understanding, and ability to sell an idea.<\/p>\n<p>The market doesn&rsquo;t reward ideas alone. It rewards execution.<\/p>\n<p>Step in. Your next big idea is waiting to be built.<\/p>\n<p>- Unnati (Skill Development Centre, JMC) x Prarambh (Incubation Centre, JMC)<\/p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to undergraduate students from all disciplines<\/li>\n<li>Team size: 2-4 members<\/li>\n<li>Cross-college teams allowed<\/li>\n<li>Multiple teams per college permitted<\/li>\n<li>Rounds: 3 (2 Online, 1 Offline)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Round 1 is a timed online quiz. Participants must adhere to the quiz instructions and time limits.<\/li>\n<li>Only shortlisted teams from Round 1 will proceed to Round 2.<\/li>\n<li>In Round 2, shortlisted teams will create\/choose a product and submit a picture of the product along with a short note explaining their product choice and concept.<\/li>\n<li>Only shortlisted teams from Round 2 will qualify for the final pitching round.<\/li>\n<li>Round 3 will be an offline pitching round at Jesus &amp; Mary College, New Delhi, where teams will present their product before the judging panel.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must adhere to the instructions and time limits specified for each round.<\/li>\n<li>Plagiarism or any form of unfair practice may lead to disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>All decisions regarding shortlisting, judging, and disqualification will rest with the organising committee and judges.<\/li>\n<li>The organising committee reserves the right to make necessary changes to the competition schedule or guidelines, with due communication to participants.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Stand a chance to win exciting cash prizes ","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33506221,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T01:58:21+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:00:49+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"vFmoLIq","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":39,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-03 21:20:39","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6